                          Microsoft NDIS Capture                          ms_ndiscap         True
                          NDIS Usermode I/O Protocol                      ms_ndisuio         True
                          NetBIOS Interface                               ms_netbios         True
                          WINS Client(TCP/IP) Protocol                    ms_netbt           True
                          QoS Packet Scheduler                            ms_pacer           True
                          Point to Point Protocol Over Ethernet           ms_pppoe           True
                          Microsoft RDMA - NDK                            ms_rdma_ndk        True
