                  The schema GUID of the object to which the access rule applies. If the permission entry shouldn't be restricted to a specific object type, use the zero guid (00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000).	
                  The "ObjectType" property of the ADObjectPermissionEntry resource from the ActiveDirectoryDsc DSC Resource module. 
                  +----------------------+--------------------------------------+
                  | InheritedObjectType  |                 GUID                 |
                  +----------------------+--------------------------------------+
                  | All object types     | 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 |
                  | Organizational Units | bf967aa5-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2 |
                  | Computer             | bf967a86-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2 |
